HST Office: Sheets ribbon content for 1.0.0, closer to the Office ribbon.

Commands that Sheets can run are added on the tab and group where an Office user looks for them (Paste Special,
Comma Style, a "Kiểu ô" drop-down with the preset cell styles, Insert Table, Signature Line and WordArt, page and
column breaks and the Navigator on Page Layout, Use in Formula, Create from Selection and Remove Arrows on Formulas,
CSV import, data sources, Edit Links and Clear Filter on Data, proofing language on Review, Page Layout view,
Hide/Show Sheet and Macros on View, table, picture and shape commands on their contextual tabs). The Font,
Alignment and Number groups get a launcher that opens Format Cells, Page Setup and Sheet Options one that opens the
page dialog. Format Painter and Clear Formatting show their labels. A new Help tab ("Trợ giúp") sits before
"Phần mở rộng"; the Developer tab is merged into "Phần mở rộng" (macros, extensions and options, form controls,
XML source), and its tab menu joins the "Phần mở rộng" tab menu. KeyTip letters for the launchers.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
